License: MIT

Reel calls ffmpeg, when the computer has it, to read and write video. ffmpeg is
not part of this package and is not redistributed with it; it is used as any
program on the computer is used. ffmpeg is licensed separately (LGPL or GPL,
depending on how it was built).
